                "question": "Do you offer exchanges?",
                "answer": "<p>We do not normally process exchanges as direct product-for-product swaps.</p><p>The original product must first be returned and approved under this policy.</p><p>A replacement product may then be shipped under the applicable replacement procedure, or a new order may be placed as instructed by our support team.</p>"
