                "answer": "<p>Nothing in this Payment Policy, Shipping Policy, Warranty Policy, Return &amp; Refund Policy, or related Terms of Service is intended to exclude, restrict, or modify any consumer right, legal guarantee, remedy, or liability that cannot legally be excluded, restricted, or modified.</p><p>Where mandatory law provides the customer with greater protection than this policy, the mandatory legal protection will apply.</p>"
